id: s-cells-super-specialist
name: Super Specialist
order: 4
optionOf: super-saiyan-1-s-cells
optionEffect: 3
choose: foundation
description: >
  Upon gaining this effect, select a Foundation. Increase your Strike Rolls and Wound Rolls for that Foundation by 1(T) and 2(T) respectively while you have a Battle Born stack in their respective Combat Rolls.
text: >
  Super Specialist [Permanent, Passive]: Upon gaining this effect, select a Foundation. Increase your Strike Rolls and Wound Rolls for that Foundation by 1(T) and 2(T) respectively while you have a Battle Born stack in their respective Combat Rolls.

---

[passive, effect 3]
if (battlebornstrike.stacks >= 1) {
    strike.$choice += 1(T);
}
if (battlebornwound.stacks >= 1) {
    wound.$choice += 2(T);
}
